<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Panamco started as &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panamco started as &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ing barings brokerage said Wednesaday it initiated coveraged of Mexican bottler Panamerican Beverages (Panamco) with a buy rating.</p>
<p>&quot;Panamco is expected to register a 16 percent earnings per share advance in 1997, reflecting the anticipated rebound of the Mexican economy and the soft drink industry,&quot; analyst Marla Marrion said in a report.</p>
</text>
